This directory contains the modified files to use a Vadic 3451 as both
dialup and dialout.  The same strategy could be put into the other dialer
routines.  Define DIALUP in uucp.h to turn this on.  It requires two names
for the communications line and the kernel change to disable modem control
(DZ_SOFTCAR/DH_SOFTCAR) on one of them.  The line without modem control
should be listed as the "autodialer", the other as the line.
